<section id="seasons" class="py-16 bg-white">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4">
    <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight mb-2">Best Time to Visit</h2>
    <p class="text-gray-600 mb-8">Each season offers a different Shenzhen beach experience.</p>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-4">
      <div class="bg-pink-50 rounded-xl p-5 border border-pink-200">
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-pink-700">Spring <span class="text-xs font-normal ml-1">Mar-May</span></h3>
        <p class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-800 mt-1">20-28 C</p>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mt-2">Pleasant for coastal hikes and cycling. Water still cool but swimmable by May. Fewer crowds.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-amber-50 rounded-xl p-5 border border-amber-200">
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-amber-700">Summer <span class="text-xs font-normal ml-1">Jun-Aug</span></h3>
        <p class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-800 mt-1">28-35 C</p>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mt-2">Peak season. Hot and perfect for swimming. Weekends extremely crowded. Typhoons peak Aug-Sep.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-orange-50 rounded-xl p-5 border border-orange-200">
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-orange-700">Autumn <span class="text-xs font-normal ml-1">Sep-Nov</span></h3>
        <p class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-800 mt-1">20-28 C</p>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mt-2">The best season. Clear skies, comfortable temps, clearest water. Sept still warm for swimming.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-blue-50 rounded-xl p-5 border border-blue-200">
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-blue-700">Winter <span class="text-xs font-normal ml-1">Dec-Feb</span></h3>
        <p class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-800 mt-1">10-18 C</p>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mt-2">Too cold for swimming but beaches are peaceful. Perfect for walks, photography, and no crowds.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>